  unitName: Gray Fullbuster (Omni)
  unitId: 820548
  unitNumber: 8341
  description: A wizard who belongs to wizard's guild called Fairy Tail. A wizard
    whose magical power is making objects out of ice, Gray Fullbuster can form it
    into many different shapes and use them as weapons. He's near the top of the
    list of Fairy Tail's most talented wizards, but he also has an odd habit of stripping
    his clothes. He claims to dislike Natsu, although some believe that it's simply
    because of the difference in their elemental magics.
  summonDesc: Don't be so glum! You can't have a guild without Magic, you say? As
    long as you have friends, you'll always have a guild.
  fusionDesc: All the battles I've fought, all the memories I've lived, are the source
    of my true power! Get ready for it!
  evoDesc: I'm the master of my own will! I want to live--truly live--alongside my
    friends!
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
